---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | FloatJet';
const description = 'FloatJet privacy policy explaining how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.';
const lastUpdated = 'November 23, 2025';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 pt-24 md:pt-28 pb-16 md:pb-20">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-invert prose-lg">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-white/60 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p class="text-white/80 lead">
        At FloatJet, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy
        explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        When you visit FloatJet, we automatically collect certain information about your device and browsing behavior,
        including:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li>IP address (anonymized)</li>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Operating system</li>
        <li>Pages visited and time spent on pages</li>
        <li>Referring website</li>
        <li>General geographic location (country/region level)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Information You Provide</h3>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        We may collect information you voluntarily provide, such as:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li>Email address (if you subscribe to our newsletter)</li>
        <li>Contact form submissions</li>
        <li>Comments or feedback</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        We use the collected information to:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li>Improve our website content and user experience</li>
        <li>Analyze website traffic and usage patterns</li>
        <li>Send newsletters and updates (only with your consent)</li>
        <li>Respond to your inquiries and support requests</li>
        <li>Detect and prevent technical issues</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience. These include:
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Essential Cookies</h3>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        Required for the website to function properly. These cannot be disabled.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Analytics Cookies</h3>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        We use analytics services to understand how visitors interact with our website:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Google Analytics 4:</strong> Helps us understand traffic patterns and user behavior. Google
          Analytics uses cookies to collect anonymous data. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
                                                               class="text-sky-light hover:text-white transition-colors"
                                                               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's
            Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><strong>PostHog:</strong> Product analytics platform for understanding user interactions. <a
            href="https://posthog.com/privacy" class="text-sky-light hover:text-white transition-colors" target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">PostHog's Privacy Policy</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Managing Cookies</h3>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        You can control cookies through your browser settings. Most browsers allow you to refuse cookies or delete
        existing ones. Note that disabling cookies may affect some website functionality.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Affiliate Links and Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        FloatJet participates in affiliate marketing programs. When you click on affiliate links on our site, you may be
        redirected to third-party websites. These websites have their own privacy policies that govern data collection.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        Our affiliate partners may use cookies to track referrals. We do not control these cookies or have access to the
        data they collect. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        <strong>Affiliate networks we work with include:</strong> Impact Radius, ShareASale, CJ Affiliate, and direct
        affiliate programs from various software companies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Data Security</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data against
        unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no internet transmission is 100% secure,
        and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Data Retention</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy,
        unless a longer retention period is required by law. Analytics data is typically retained for 26 months.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">For EU/EEA Residents (GDPR)</h3>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Right to Access:</strong> Request a copy of your personal data</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Erasure:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Restrict Processing:</strong> Request limited processing of your data</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Data Portability:</strong> Request transfer of your data</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Object:</strong> Object to processing based on legitimate interests</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">For California Residents (CCPA)</h3>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Right to Know:</strong> Request information about data collection practices</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Delete:</strong> Request deletion of your personal information</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Opt-Out:</strong> Opt out of the sale of personal information (Note: We do not sell
          personal information)
        </li>
        <li><strong>Right to Non-Discrimination:</strong> Equal service regardless of privacy choices</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-white/80 mt-6">
        To exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the information provided below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        FloatJet is not intended for children under 16 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information
        from children. If you believe we have collected data from a child, please contact us immediately.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material changes by posting the
        new policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this policy
        periodically.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        If you have any questions about this privacy policy or our data practices, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@floatjet.com"
                                   class="text-sky-light hover:text-white transition-colors">privacy@floatjet.com</a>
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm">
          This privacy policy is effective as of {lastUpdated}.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
